# test-quarantine bypass-guard migration allowlist (PRD §8.1, M5 pilot).
#
# Repo-relative package.json paths permitted to still invoke jest directly
# during the pilot-first rollout. The per-PR bypass guard skips these so it
# does not block their PRs; it still enforces that the MIGRATED packages do
# not regress and that NEW packages route through the wrapper.
#
# Full rollout (mechanical codemod follow-up) removes lines here as packages
# are migrated. When this file is empty the guard enforces on the whole repo.
#
# Regenerate after a codemod batch:
#   node tools/test-quarantine/bin/test-quarantine.mjs bypass-guard \
#     | grep -E '^  - ' | sed -E 's#^  - ([^ ]+)  \[.*#\1#' | sort -u

